'''Classic Knife,''' or '''Default Knife,''' was a [[:Category:Knives|knife]] given to players by default upon joining a game of [[Murder Mystery]]. Instead of being transformed into a [[Vintage Weapons|vintage]] like all of the other Murder Mystery weapons, it was replaced by the [[Default Knife]] with the release of [[Murder Mystery 2]], along with [[Classic Gun]], which was replaced with [[Default Gun]].

== Appearance ==
Classic Knife had a thick, gray blade with scratches and brown stains. The side of the blade had two chips, the upper one larger than the bottom one. The knife had a curved light gray guard and a curved wooden handle, which was proportionately much smaller than the blade.

== Trivia ==
*Unlike the other weapons from Murder Mystery, this and its [[Classic Gun|partner gun]] are no longer obtainable due to their removal.
*Classic Knife's model is based off a gear made by ROBLOX called [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/20721924/Spartan-Sword Spartan Sword] which is sold for 175 Robux.

